<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Chunked TabPFN: Exact Training-Free In-Context Learning for Long-Context Tabular Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Core idea (log-sum-exp merge).</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Chunked TabPFN: Exact Training-Free In-Context Learning for Long-Context Tabular Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Algorithm (pseudocode).</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Chunked TabPFN: Exact Training-Free In-Context Learning for Long-Context Tabular Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Correctness sketch.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Chunked TabPFN: Exact Training-Free In-Context Learning for Long-Context Tabular Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Complexity.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px7" title="In Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Chunked TabPFN: Exact Training-Free In-Context Learning for Long-Context Tabular Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Numerical notes.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px8" title="In Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Chunked TabPFN: Exact Training-Free In-Context Learning for Long-Context Tabular Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Implementation hints (PyTorch).</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px9" title="In Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Chunked TabPFN: Exact Training-Free In-Context Learning for Long-Context Tabular Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">When to chunk <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS0.SSS0.Px10" title="In Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Chunked TabPFN: Exact Training-Free In-Context Learning for Long-Context Tabular Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Limitations.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Chunked TabPFN: Exact Training-Free In-Context Learning for Long-Context Tabular Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Full Results on TabArena</span></a></li>
